msgid "1744986195408"
msgstr "1744986195408"

#: ../../source/functions/utilities/macro_player.md:7
msgid "In the FlexDesigner"
msgstr "FlexDesigner で"

#: ../../source/functions/utilities/macro_player.md:9
msgid "![1744986859802](image/macro_player/1744986859802.png)"
msgstr "![1744986859802](image/macro_player/1744986859802.png)"

#: ../../source/functions/utilities/macro_player.md:9
msgid "1744986859802"
msgstr "1744986859802"

#: ../../source/functions/utilities/macro_player.md:11
msgid "Open the recorder interface on Flexbar"
msgstr "Flexbar でレコーダー インターフェイスを開きます"

#: ../../source/functions/utilities/macro_player.md:12
#: ../../source/functions/utilities/macro_player.md:26
msgid "Current mouse coordinates"
msgstr "現在のマウス座標"

#: ../../source/functions/utilities/macro_player.md:13
#: ../../source/functions/utilities/macro_player.md:27
msgid "Currently pressed keys"
msgstr "現在押されているキー"

#: ../../source/functions/utilities/macro_player.md:14
msgid "Select a saved recording"
msgstr "保存済みの記録を選択します"

#: ../../source/functions/utilities/macro_player.md:15
msgid "Edit/delete recordings"
msgstr "記録の編集/削除"

#: ../../source/functions/utilities/macro_player.md:16
msgid ""
"Test the selected recording, **Note: clicking this will immediately play "
"your recorded macro**"
msgstr "選択した記録をテストします。**注: これをクリックすると、記録されたマクロがすぐに再生されます**"

#: ../../source/functions/utilities/macro_player.md:17
msgid "Adjust playback speed"
msgstr "再生速度を調整する"

#: ../../source/functions/utilities/macro_player.md:18
msgid "Set the number of times to play the recording"
msgstr "録音を再生する回数を設定します"

#: ../../source/functions/utilities/macro_player.md:20
msgid ""
"Click `OPEN RECORDER` to start recording a macro. You'll need to complete "
"the recording on your Flexbar."
msgstr "「OPEN RECORDER」をクリックしてマクロの記録を開始します。記録の完了は Flexbar 上で行います。"

#: ../../source/functions/utilities/macro_player.md:22
msgid "![1744986676793](image/macro_player/1744986676793.png)"
msgstr "![1744986676793](image/macro_player/1744986676793.png)"

#: ../../source/functions/utilities/macro_player.md:22
msgid "1744986676793"
msgstr "1744986676793"

#: ../../source/functions/utilities/macro_player.md:24
msgid "Start/Stop recording"
msgstr "記録の開始/停止"

#: ../../source/functions/utilities/macro_player.md:25
msgid "Recording duration (MM:SS)"
msgstr "記録時間 (MM:SS)"

#: ../../source/functions/utilities/macro_player.md:28
msgid "Save this recording"
msgstr "この記録を保存します"

#: ../../source/functions/utilities/macro_player.md:29
msgid "Play/Stop this recording"
msgstr "この記録を再生/停止します"

#: ../../source/functions/utilities/macro_player.md:31
msgid ""
"After saving your recording, it will appear in the Function Tab where you "
"can select and use your previously recorded macros."
msgstr "記録を保存すると、「機能」タブに表示され、これまでに記録したマクロを選択して使用できます。"

#: ../../source/functions/utilities/macro_player.md:33
msgid ""
"Once you've selected a recorded macro and uploaded it to your Flexbar, "
"simply press this key on your Flexbar to play the macro."
msgstr "記録されたマクロを選択して Flexbar にアップロードしたら、Flexbar でこのキーを押すだけでマクロを再生できます。"
